---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+16105550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(610) 555-0199';
---
<Layout 
  title="HVAC Maintenance Phoenixville PA | Seasonal Tune-Ups"
  description="Professional HVAC maintenance in Phoenixville, PA. Spring and fall tune-ups that improve efficiency, extend equipment life, and prevent breakdowns."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> → Services → HVAC Maintenance</div>
      <h1>HVAC Maintenance in Phoenixville, PA</h1>
      <p>Regular maintenance keeps your system efficient, safe, and less likely to fail during extreme weather.</p>
      <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Schedule a Tune-Up — {phoneDisplay}</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <h2>What a Professional Tune-Up Includes</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Inspect and clean filters, coils, and drain lines</li>
        <li>Check refrigerant levels and electrical connections</li>
        <li>Test safety controls, ignition, and combustion (gas systems)</li>
        <li>Lubricate motors and inspect belts/bearings</li>
        <li>Verify thermostat operation and airflow</li>
        <li>Measure temperature split and system performance</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We recommend spring (cooling) and fall (heating) visits for most Phoenixville homes.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:2.5rem;text-align:center">
        <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Book Maintenance — {phoneDisplay}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
